DIA GeForce RTX 5090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-6000 CL30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 44)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n### `master`\r\n\r\n```\r\n--- GDScript alloc bench, N=1000000, reps=7 ---\r\nObject.new+free   : median 76.2 ns/op, min 75.7, max 76.8\r\nNode.new+free     : median 81.0 ns/op, min 80.9, max 81.8\r\nRefCounted.new    : median 158.9 ns/op, min 158.8, max 159.0\r\nResource.new      : median 162.0 ns/op, min 161.9, max 162.1\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Peak memory usage according to `time -f \"%M\"` (average of 3 runs): 103509 KB\r\n- On 3D platformer demo (average of 20 runs): 699785 KB\r\n\r\n### This PR\r\n\r\n```\r\n--- GDScript alloc bench, N=1000000, reps=7 ---\r\nObject.new+free   : median 71.7 ns/op, min 71.5, max 72.0\r\nNode.new+free     : median 78.4 ns/op, min 78.4, max 78.6\r\nRefCounted.new    : median 154.7 ns/op, min 154.7, max 154.8\r\nResource.new      : median 157.9 ns/op, min 157.9, max 157.9\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Peak memory usage according to `time -f \"%M\"` (average of 3 runs): 102292 KB\r\n- On 3D platformer demo (average of 20 runs): 698503 KB\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Script to test peak memory usage</summary>\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\r\nset -euo pipefail\r\nIFS=$'\\n\\t'\r\n\r\nTOTAL_MEM=0\r\nfor _ in {0..19}; do\r\n    MEM=$(/usr/bin/time -f \"%M\" bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64.master --path ~/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/3d/platformer/ --quit-after 10 2>&1 | tail -1)\r\n    TOTAL_MEM=$((TOTAL_MEM + MEM))\r\ndone\r\n\r\nAVERAGE_MEM=$((TOTAL_MEM / 20))\r\necho \"Average memory usage (master): $AVERAGE_MEM\"\r\n\r\nTOTAL_MEM=0\r\nfor _ in {0..19}; do\r\n    MEM=$(/usr/bin/time -f \"%M\" bin/godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64 --path ~/Documents/Git/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/3d/platformer/ --quit-after 10 2>&1 | tail -1)\r\n    TOTAL_MEM=$((TOTAL_MEM + MEM))\r\ndone\r\n\r\nAVERAGE_MEM=$((TOTAL_MEM / 20))\r\necho \"Average memory usage (PR): $AVERAGE_MEM\"\r\n```\r\n</details>","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119985#pullrequestreview-4811812837","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119985","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119985#pullrequestreview-4811812837"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119985"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-29T18:44:39Z","commit_id":"b3b5d460e80ece7b0f430770a2d498bd31fc08ed"}]